    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d312">

                <pb facs="0556" n="452" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg452"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.51/3701a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Germany (Dodd)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-10-06T18:00:00-05:00">October 6, 1933—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>121. Can you secure figures American capital now invested in Germany covering
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>) long term bond investment, (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">b</hi>) other long term investment, (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">c</hi>) short term included in Standstill, (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">d</hi>) short term not included in Standstill, by any
                    categories into which they may be divisible.</p>
                <p>Also is estimate available of amounts of blocked accounts due to Americans
                    divided according to their origin (that is, whether arising out of unpaid bond
                    interest, blocked Standstill payments, et cetera), and according to the
                    categories distinguished in your despatch No. 128 of September 7.<anchor n="92"
                        xml:id="d312-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Estimates received in the past by the Department from different sources do not
                    agree. We realize the difficulty of securing the exact <pb facs="0557" n="453"
                        xml:id="pg453"/> figures but would appreciate best possible estimates by
                    telegram and more comprehensive report by mail.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
